clock_model_service
====================

This microservice serves the ChessMimic "clock model" (predicts how long a
human would think on a chess move) for a personal, noncommercial hobby project.

It uses the trained model checkpoint, scalers, bucket metadata, and portions of
the model/inference code from the ChessMimic project:

    1e4_ai by Thomas Johnson
    https://github.com/thomasj02/1e4_ai

