  - clock_bucket_utils.py  (derived from Training/clock_bucket_utils.py)
  - predictor.py           (replicates backend/clock_inference.py ClockPredictor)
  - models/model.ckpt      (trained checkpoint)
  - models/scalers.pkl     (feature scalers)
  - models/clock_buckets.json (bucket boundaries + empirical distributions)

